      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The target this time: an Infected\r\nGorecyclops at Galewing Plateau — one where the\r\ninfection has advanced strikingly far.",
        "Jp" : "今回の討伐対象は《翼風高原》に現れた\r\n侵食ゴアサイクロプスだが、\r\nこいつがまた派手に侵食が進んだ個体だ"
