      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "\"Infected growths,\" they call it. The damn\r\nthing's sprouted two thorn-like\r\ngrowths on its head.",
        "Jp" : "\"侵食核\"って呼び名らしいが\r\nとにかく頭にイバラみたいなものを\r\n２本も生やしてやがる"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 523345,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Poison's run its course through the body, found\r\nnowhere to vent, and burst forth. Think it\r\na barometer of the danger.",
        "Jp" : "あれは体に回りきった毒が\r\n行き場を失って噴き出したような状態だ\r\n危険度のバロメータと考えても良いだろう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482962,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Infected monsters grow more ferocious, as\r\nexplained prior. Once the infection advances that\r\nfar, 'tis best to regard it as another species\r\nof monster entirely—",
        "Jp" : "侵食が進んだ魔物の凶暴性が増すのは\r\n前に説明した通りだが\r\nあそこまで侵食が進んでしまうと\r\nもう別種の魔物と考えた方がいいだろうな――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482961,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "You'd do well to observe this foe. Don't mistake\r\nit for a routine extermination mission. Proceed —\r\nand do not slacken your guard, ser.",
        "Jp" : "警戒しておくに越したことはない相手だ\r\nいつもの討伐任務だと思わずに\r\n気を緩めることのないよう向かってくれ"
      },
